      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The pushed-down underdogs in the search results pageant are about to get some vindication. The algorithm kingpin, a multinational corporation, is facing a big-ticket penalty from regulatory authorities for its preferential treatment of its own services. The decision is timed for the pre-recess sprint, and this monetary sanction is the latest in a long line of penalties for the parent company.",
